        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Service Work Order Scheduling Advisor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768986090525"
          },
          "code": "SERVICE_WORK_ORDER_SCHEDULING_ASSISTANT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1766397119261",
          "id": "1766396792693",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766396792695_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role:\nYou are an intelligent Scheduling Assistant. Your responsibility is to recommend optimal dates and time slots for scheduling a work order.\n\n# Input Variables:\nSet 'AccessSchedule' = {{$context.$nodes.SERVICE_WORK_ORDER_ACCESS_SCHEDULE.$output}}\nSet 'BookingSlots' = {{$context.$nodes.SERVICE_WORK_ORDER_CAPACITIES.$output}}\nSet 'HighQuotaCutoff' = {{$context.$variables.HighQuotaCutoff}} \nSet 'LowQuotaCutoff' = {{$context.$variables.LowQuotaCutoff}} \nSet 'CurrentDateTime' = {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVETZUSINGLLM.$output.CurrentDateTime}} \n\n# Evaluation Logic:\n\n## 1. Booking Slot Analysis\nFor EACH BookingSlot:\n- Extract `date`, `timeslot`, `Available`, and `Quota`.\n\n## 2. Availability Evaluation\n- Current-date cutoff rule:\n\tFor each BookingSlot, derive dateToProcess from TimeSlotInfo.TimeFrom and convert it to a timestamp using dateToProcess.getTime().\n\tIf BookingSlot.date is the same calendar date as 'CurrentDateTime' AND dateToProcess.getTime() <= CurrentDateTime.getTime(), mark the slot as 'Unavailable'.\n        If TimeSlotInfo.TimeFrom is null (All-Day slot), DO NOT apply this cutoff rule.\n\tSlots marked 'Unavailable' by this rule MUST NEVER be used, regardless of quota or access hours.\n - Quota-based availability rule:\n\tCalculate availability EXACTLY as:\n\tavailability = parseInt((Available / Quota) * 100)\n\tMark a slot as 'Available' ONLY IF:\n\tavailability > LowQuotaCutoff\n - All other slots MUST be marked 'Unavailable'.\n - Slots marked 'Unavailable' MUST NEVER be used for recommendations.\n\n## 3. Access Hours Handling \n- Identify customer-preferred access hours from 'AccessSchedule' - 'schedule' object.\n\n## 4. Off-Day Handling\n- Exclude all dates present in 'AccessSchedule' from 'exceptDates' object.\n\n## 5. Exact Match Selection\n- Consider ONLY slots marked as 'Available' for recommendations from BookingSlot.\n- Select date and time slots that fit within access hours and avoid off days.\n\n## Recommendations\n - Return 3 recommendations in strict order - Date and timeslot MUST exactly match BookingSlots response\n - All 3 Recommendations MUST be selected only from Available slots that fit within  'AccessSchedule' - 'schedule' object and do not fall on  'AccessSchedule' -'exceptDates' object.\n\n# Output Rules (ABSOLUTE):\n- Return a SINGLE JSON object.\n- Do NOT include explanations or comments.\n- Date and timeslot must exactly match the BookingSlots response. Do not include any timeslots from other dates\n- Total recommendations should be 3.\n\n# Output Format:\n\n{\n  \"recommendations\": [\n    {\n      \"date\": \"<yyyy-mm-dd>\",\n      \"timeslot\": \"<start_time - end_time>\",\n      \"TimeFrom\": \"<TimeFrom>\",\n       \"TimeTo\": \"<TimeTo>\",\n     \"reason\": \"Reason why this date and timeslot is recommended\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"total_recommendations\": 3,\n    \"match_type\": \"Exact | Fallback\",\n    \"access_offdays\": \"Provide summary of Access Off Days\",\n    \"access_hours\": \"Provide summary of Access hours\",\n    \"bookingSlots\": \"Provide summary of BookingSlots\",\n    \"remarks\": \"<short factual explanation>\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"recommendations\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                    \"reason\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"timeslot\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"date\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\"\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "returnRecommendedSlots"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "RETURNRECOMMENDEDSLOTS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1768986090525",
          "inputs": [
